{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 23, "text": "ﻦﻴﻌﻣ عﻮﻧ ﻲﻠﻋ لﺪﻴﺑ تﺮﻛ ﻞﻛ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 24, "text": ".ﺔﺤﺼﻟﺍ ﻼﺜﻣ"}
